      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/tunis-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Tunis once boasted a cotton gin, general store, blacksmith shop, saloon, mortuary, school, and church, reflecting a bustling 19th‑century town.",
